WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.778
To check a patient's latest vital signs,

1.2
00:00:02.778 --> 00:00:07.386
open the encounter and find the Vitals panel on the Overview tab.

2.1
00:00:07.386 --> 00:00:09.333
Read the latest values.

2.2
00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:14.792
Each row is a vital sign, and each column is one of the four latest times,

2.3
00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:16.251
newest first.

3.1
00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:20.646
Check the normal range next to each name, and any flagged values.

3.2
00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:26.503
A vital sign recorded with a questionnaire has no normal range and is never flagged.

4.1
00:00:26.503 --> 00:00:31.673
Select All readings for the history of all the vital signs in the panel,

4.2
00:00:31.673 --> 00:00:36.046
or select one name, here Temperature, for that vital sign alone.

4.3
00:00:36.046 --> 00:00:39.898
Care opens the history panel.
